OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian market set to reopen
OL,4,Aafter #11m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders are preparing to move back into
OL,7,FAccrington Market Hall after an #11m
OL,8,Frefurbishment.
OL,10,FThe Victorian market closed in 2023 for
OL,11,Fthe redevelopment.
OL,13,FStallholders who have been operating
OL,14,Ffrom outdoor cabins have started
OL,15,Frelocating ahead of trading beginning
OL,16,Finside the hall on Thursday.
OL,18,FHyndburn Borough Council said the
OL,19,Fmarket would officially reopen on 26
OL,20,FNovember during the borough's Christmas
OL,21,Flights switch-on celebrations.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
